  "title": "Roast in a Slow Cooker",
  "description": "Make dinner preparation a breeze by using this slow cooker pot roast recipe using cream of mushroom soup and prepared gravy for a savory main course.",
  "authors": [
    "Sue Farnsworth Sattel"
  ],
